summary: Test that confirms that mlock called from a user process makes the targeted memory resident
description: |
  Memory Mamagement Risk Assesment test that checks if an invocation of mlock
  makes the targeted memory loaded and locked in physical memory.
contact: Filippo Storniolo <fstornio@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
id: 90d8ad45-d83e-43b7-97a8-497880c7b23a
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - gcc
  - make
duration: 10m
